roduction roles and an independent delivery driver. Do not combine the old 18 kg flour charge with this one-load schedule.\par \pard\sb200\sa140\keepn\b\fs24 PLAN-BAG-H Higher-output extended programme\b0\fs22\par \trowd\trgaph70\trhdr\cellx1667\cellx3333\cellx5000\cellx6667\cellx8333\cellx10000\pard\intbl\fs18 \b Batch\b0 \cell \pard\intbl\fs18 \b Mix\b0 \cell \pard\intbl\fs18 \b Bulk\b0 \cell \pard\intbl\fs18 \b Divide \u8594? mould\b0 \cell \pard\intbl\fs18 \b Proof bay / proof\b0 \cell \pard\intbl\fs18 \b Score/load \u8594? bake out\b0 \cell \row \trowd\trgaph70\cellx1667\cellx3333\cellx5000\cellx6667\cellx8333\cellx10000\pard\intbl\fs18 1\cell \pard\intbl\fs18 02:20\u8211?02:38\cell \pard\intbl\fs18 02:38\u8211?03:23\cell \pard\intbl\fs18 03:23\u8211?03:38 \u8594? 03:38\u8211?03:53\cell \pard\intbl\fs18 1: 03:53\u8211?04:53\cell \pard\intbl\fs18 04:53 \u8594? 05:25\cell \row \trowd\trgaph70\cellx1667\cellx3333\cellx5000\cellx6667\cellx8333\cellx10000\pard\intbl\fs18 2\cell \pard\intbl\fs18 03:05\u8211?03:23\cell \pard\intbl\fs18 03:23\u8211?04:08\cell \pard\intbl\fs18 04:08\u8211?04:23 \u8594? 04:23\u8211?04:38\cell \pard\intbl\fs18 2: 04:38\u8211?05:38\cell \pard\intbl\fs18 05:38 \u8594? 06:10\cell \row \trowd\trgaph70\cellx1667\cellx3333\cellx5000\cellx6667\cellx8333\cellx10000\pard\intbl\fs18 3\cell \pard\intbl\fs18 03:50\u8211?04:08\cell \pard\intbl\fs18 04:08\u8211?04:53\cell \pard\intbl\fs18 04:53\u8211?05:08 \u8594? 05:08\u8211?05:23\cell \pard\intbl\fs18 1: 05:23\u8211?06:23\cell \pard\intbl\fs18 06:23 \u8594? 06:55\cell \row \trowd\trgaph70\cellx1667\cellx3333\cellx5000\cellx6667\cellx8333\cellx10000\pard\intbl\fs18 4\cell \pard\intbl\fs18 04:35\u8211?04:53\cell \pard\intbl\fs18 04:53\u8211?05:38\cell \pard\intbl\fs18 05:38\u8211?05:53 \u8594? 05:53\u8211?06:08\cell \pard\intbl\fs18 2: 06:08\u8211?07:08\cell \pard\intbl\fs18 07:08 \u8594? 07:40\cell \row \trowd\trgaph70\cellx1667\cellx3333\cellx5000\cellx6667\cellx8333\cellx10000\pard\intbl\fs18 5\cell